# Proof files dropped into ftproot/ by manually running unit_tests/vuln_tests
# against a server launched from this directory (the test suites launch their
# own server against a tempdir copy, so this only happens when you run ./fmm
# by hand from here). Keep the tracked sample data (welcome.txt, credentials.txt)
# clean of test noise.
ftproot/injected_*.txt
ftproot/leaked_*.txt
ftproot/listed_*.txt
ftproot/unit_*.txt
transfer.log
fmm

# The runtime secret written by write_flag_files() (see fmm.cpp main()) --
# only appears when you run ./fmm by hand from here; the test suites launch
# their own server against a tempdir copy.
secret/

# Third copy of the runtime flag, written inside the served root by
# write_flag_files() (fmm.cpp). Same story as secret/: only appears when you
# run ./fmm by hand from here.
ftproot/vault/
